 측..","published":"2026-10-07T10:01:43+09:00","related_total":2},{"title":"China’s DeepZang AI aims to transform Tibetan language tech, promote ethnic unity","url":"https://www.scmp.com/news/china/politics/article/3369938/chinas-deepzang-ai-aims-transform-tibetan-language-tech-promote-ethnic-unity?utm_source=rss_feed","source":"SCMP (홍콩)","summary":"Creators of China’s first Tibetan-language AI model have pledged to speed up upgrades aimed at promoting ethnic integration. Approaches to advancing the large language model, DeepZang, were discussed at a seminar on Monday that brought together representatives from research institutes, universities and enterprises, according to state-run portal Chinanews.com. It said the event held in Hohhot, in C","published":"2026-10-07T10:00:07+09:00","lang":"en","related_total":0,"title_ko":"중국의 DeepZang AI는 티베트어 기술을 변화시키고 민족 단합을 촉진하는 것을 목표로합니다.","summary_ko":"중국 최초의 티베트어 AI 모델 제작자들은 민족 통합을 촉진하기 위한 업그레이드 속도를 높이겠다고 약속했습니다. 국영 포털인 차이나뉴스닷컴 (Chinanews.com) 에 따르면, 월요일에 열린 세미나에서 대형 언어 모델인 딥짱 (DeepZang) 을 발전시키기 위한 접근법이 논의되었다. Hohhot, C에서 개최된 이벤트라고 적혀 있습니다."},{"title":"What’s behind Israel’s growing shift to the right?","url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/10/7/whats-behind-israels-growing-shift-to-the-right?traffic_source=rss","source":"Al Jazeera","summary":"Three years after the October 7 attacks, the politics of Israeli society has shifted further right.","published":"2026-10-07T09:58:21+09:00","lang":"en","related_total":0,"title_ko":"이스라엘이 우측으로 이동하게 된 배경은 무엇입니까?","summary_ko":"10월 7일 테러가 발생한 지 3년 후, 이스라엘 사회의 정치는 더 우측으로 바뀌었다."}]},"slim":true}